<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34056" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pastĭnāca</span></b> , ae,
			f.
		pastino. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A parsnip</i>, a term including also our <i>carrot</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 19, 5,
				27, § 89</span></i>; <i><span class="en">25, 9, 64, §
			112</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Isid. Orig. 17,
			10</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A fish of prey</i>, <i>the
			sting-ray</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 9, 42, 67, § 144</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">9, 48, 72, §
				155</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cels. 6, 9</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
